# ca_roots.pem — curated CA trust anchors for the E-ink Todo RTOS firmware.
#
# This file is the INPUT to gen_crt_bundle.py (CONFIG_MBEDTLS_CERTIFICATE_BUNDLE
# custom-list mode); the generated bundle ships in flash and is the tier-1 TLS
# trust store. The same PEMs are also embedded directly into the firmware image
# for the tier-2 esp_tls_set_global_ca_store() fallback path
# (CONFIG_EINKTODO_TLS_TIER2_GLOBAL_CA_STORE). See .migration/04-rtos-architecture.md
# section 3.4 and R4.
#
# Trust material is refreshed by firmware OTA only (10-day cadence). Roots live
# for decades; einktodo.com is Cloudflare-fronted and Cloudflare rotates edge
# issuers among Google Trust Services / Let's Encrypt (ISRG) / SSL.com, so all
# three issuer families are anchored here.
#
# Live chains verified 2026-06-12 against this exact set (openssl Verify OK):
#   www.einktodo.com  <- GTS WE1   <- GTS Root R4 <- GlobalSign Root CA
#   letsencrypt.org   <- LE E7     <- ISRG Root X1
#
# Roots (subject | SHA-256 fingerprint):
#   GTS Root R1  D9:47:43:2A:BD:E7:B7:FA:90:FC:2E:6B:59:10:1B:12:80:E0:E1:C7:E4:E4:0F:A3:C6:88:7F:FF:57:A7:F4:CF
#   GTS Root R2  8D:25:CD:97:22:9D:BF:70:35:6B:DA:4E:B3:CC:73:40:31:E2:4C:F0:0F:AF:CF:D3:2D:C7:6E:B5:84:1C:7E:A8
#   GTS Root R3  34:D8:A7:3E:E2:08:D9:BC:DB:0D:95:65:20:93:4B:4E:40:E6:94:82:59:6E:8B:6F:73:C8:42:6B:01:0A:6F:48
#   GTS Root R4  34:9D:FA:40:58:C5:E2:63:12:3B:39:8A:E7:95:57:3C:4E:13:13:C8:3F:E6:8F:93:55:6C:D5:E8:03:1B:3C:7D
#   GlobalSign Root CA  EB:D4:10:40:E4:BB:3E:C7:42:C9:E3:81:D3:1E:F2:A4:1A:48:B6:68:5C:96:E7:CE:F3:C1:DF:6C:D4:33:1C:99
